    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "“Sin is Byzantine and love is ancient” (Op. 50, 1992): songs to poetry by Dinos Christianopoulos and Giorgos Chronas. The composer managed to set 18 of the 26 poems he had chosen. It came out after his death, in 1996; the final track features his own voice."
